// Maqam Rast — Arabic just-intonation scale (zalzalian)
// Uses the authentic Arabic degree names of maqam Rast:
//   rast dukah sikah jaharkah nawa husayni awj
// sikah (3rd) and awj (7th) are NEUTRAL — the quarter-tone signature of the maqam.

@core
@controls
@alphabet.arabic:browser
@tuning:maqam_rast
@mm:70

S -> Sayr Rujoo Qarar

Sayr -> rast dukah sikah jaharkah nawa husayni awj (wave:sine, vel:85)
Rujoo -> awj husayni nawa jaharkah sikah dukah rast (vel:70)
Qarar -> rast _ _ _ _ (vel:60)
